Phase-13 demography/migration, household resale/replanning, M5+ behavior and mirror edits remain out of scope."
REQ-PRODUCTION-006,IMPLEMENTED,601,602,,"PR #602 implements Handoff/05 Phase-12 real-goods capital formation and depreciation. planCapitalFormationPhase12 reads only canonical ProductionUnit investmentInventory, installedCapital and immutable recipe coefficients, computes possible capital as the stable-good minimum inventory/coefficient ratio, consumes complete investment-good bundles exactly once, increases the sole installedCapital authority once, then applies recipe depreciation exactly once to post-formation capital with no money transaction or cash recipient. applyCapitalFormationTransition requires exactly one current execution per ProductionUnit, recomputes the deterministic evidence against current authoritative stock to reject stale/tampered replay, preserves INPUT/OUTPUT inventories, wallets, signals and unrelated world state, and returns a new WorldState. The Phase-12 handler records tick-scoped evidence only, so its result cannot affect already-completed same-tick Phase-5 capacity and becomes usable only through the explicit state transition. Focused regressions in src/simulation/capitalFormation.test.ts prove exact multi-good conversion, partial-bundle accumulation, post-formation depreciation, no-cash behavior, zero-investment-recipe depreciation, stale/tampered and missing-unit refusal, insertion-order determinism, handler immutability/next-state capacity, and non-finite/invalid coefficient rejection. Phase-14 lifecycle, integrated M4 orchestration and M5+ remain separate requirements."
